Description: notify systemd once the server is ready
 The server sends READY=1 to $NOTIFY_SOCKET (the sd_notify protocol, without
 libsystemd) once uvicorn listens, so the Type=notify unit becomes active when
 it can serve. Without $NOTIFY_SOCKET nothing changes, except that start()
 returns once uvicorn listens or has given up.
